        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/method/starlayergraph.graph.starlayer_dataset.StarLayerDataset._load_context>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/method/starlayergraph.graph.starlayer_dataset.StarLayerDataset._read_source>,
