<https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/class/starlayergraph.graph.starlayer_graph.StarLayerGraph> a slkg:Class ;
    rdfs:label "StarLayerGraph" ;
    rdfs:comment """rdflib.Graph extended with RDF 1.2 triple-term support.

Triple terms are represented as Python 3-tuples or TripleTerm objects.
Internally they are encoded as content-addressed URIRefs under TT_NS in
the rdflib store; that encoding is completely hidden from callers.

All unoverridden rdflib.Graph methods (namespace management, SPARQL,
serialization, etc.) are inherited and work without modification.""" ;
    slkg:commentText "------------------------------------------------------------------",
        "Internal helpers (rdf-1.1 encoding layer)",
        "Native backend (rdf-1.2)",
        "Overridden rdflib.Graph methods",
        "Persistent store lifecycle",
        "RDF 1.2-specific additions" ;
    slkg:hasMethod <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/method/starlayergraph.graph.starlayer_graph.StarLayerGraph.__contains__>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/method/starlayergraph.graph.starlayer_graph.StarLayerGraph.__init__>,
