        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/parameter/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhidden-graph%2Fstarlayer%2Fkg%2Fresource%2Ffunction%2Fstarlayergraph.backends.native.native_query%3A%3Akwargs%3A%3A8>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/parameter/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhidden-graph%2Fstarlayer%2Fkg%2Fresource%2Ffunction%2Fstarlayergraph.backends.native.native_query%3A%3Aprocessor%3A%3A3>,
