per-context StarLayerGraphs all share the same underlying store (see
StarLayerDataset.get_context()), so there is exactly one store to resolve
per dataset, same as for a single graph.""" ;
    slkg:hasParameter <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/parameter/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhidden-graph%2Fstarlayer%2Fkg%2Fresource%2Ffunction%2Fstarlayergraph.backends.native.resolve_store_http%3A%3Abackend%3A%3A1>,
