<https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.lexer.split_obj_and_annotations> a slkg:Function ;
    rdfs:label "split_obj_and_annotations" ;
    rdfs:comment """Split 'obj [~ reifier [{| body |}]]* [{| body |}]*' into
(obj_token, [(reifier_or_None, body_or_None), ...]).""" ;
    slkg:commentText "A bare '~' directly followed by an annotation block is an",
        "By the time this function runs, s holds exactly one",
        "annotation body: pred=:s takes \":p :o\" as its object slot,",
        "anonymous/empty reifier that the block attaches to (W3C",
        "comma-split object (plus any ~reifier/{| |} annotation",
        "input it is).",
        "next_token grabs just \":p\", leaving stray \":o\" - previously",
        "no '{' case, so it would mis-tokenize the block's own",
        "opening \"{|\" as if it were a reifier name.",
        "predicateObjectList on ','/';'. Anything left over here is",
        "reifier ::= '~' (iri|BlankNode)? - the name is optional.",
        "second term with no separator (\"{| :s :p :o |}\" as an",
        "see tests/w3c_turtle12/). Must not call next_token() here: it has",
        "silently dropped instead of being flagged as the malformed",
        "suffixes) - the caller already split the surrounding",
        "turtle12-ann-8, \"empty reifier with annotation block\" -",
        "unexpected trailing content on that single object, e.g. a" ;
    slkg:hasParameter <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/parameter/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhidden-graph%2Fstarlayer%2Fkg%2Fresource%2Ffunction%2Fstarlayergraph.parsers.lexer.split_obj_and_annotations%3A%3As%3A%3A0> ;
    slkg:lineEnd 228 ;
    slkg:lineStart 174 ;
    slkg:qualifiedName "starlayergraph.parsers.lexer.split_obj_and_annotations" ;
    slkg:signature "def split_obj_and_annotations(s)" .

