<https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starshacl.validator._collect_by_types_properties> a slkg:Function ;
    rdfs:label "_collect_by_types_properties" ;
    rdfs:comment """The ``collectProperties(S)`` algorithm from the SHACL 1.2 Core spec's
``sh:closed sh:ByTypes`` definition: a node's own ``sh:property``/
``sh:path`` properties, plus (if it's itself a class) its superclasses'
and sibling-shapes' properties, plus (if it's a node shape) properties
of any shape it ``sh:node``-links to. ``visited`` guards against
infinite loops on cyclic class hierarchies.""" ;
    slkg:hasParameter <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/parameter/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhidden-graph%2Fstarlayer%2Fkg%2Fresource%2Ffunction%2Fstarshacl.validator._collect_by_types_properties%3A%3Ashacl_graph%3A%3A0>,
