non-native graph; StarLayerGraph's own __len__ override just never
used it for native).""" ;
    slkg:hasParameter <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/parameter/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhidden-graph%2Fstarlayer%2Fkg%2Fresource%2Fmethod%2Fstarlayergraph.graph.starlayer_graph.StarLayerGraph._native_len%3A%3Aself%3A%3A0> ;
