        "with the same query text don't redo the parse+lower work (see" ;
    slkg:hasParameter <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/parameter/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhidden-graph%2Fstarlayer%2Fkg%2Fresource%2Fmethod%2Fstarlayergraph.graph.starlayer_graph.StarLayerGraph.query%3A%3AinitBindings%3A%3A5>,
