<https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/module/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12> a slkg:Module ;
    rdfs:label "starlayergraph.parsers.trig12" ;
    dcterms:identifier "starlayergraph.parsers.trig12" ;
    rdfs:comment """starlayergraph.parsers.trig12

Parse TriG 1.2 text into triples, preserving or merging named-graph structure.

TriG 1.2 is Turtle 1.2 with optional ``GRAPH <name> { ... }`` blocks.  Each
block's content is Turtle 1.2, so this parser:

  1. Extracts PREFIX / @prefix declarations.
  2. Splits the document into graph blocks (default graph + each GRAPH block).
  3. Prepends the prefix declarations to each block's content.
  4. Parses each chunk as Turtle 1.2 via StarLayerTurtleParser.

Entry points:
    parse_trig12(text)        -> list of (s, p, o)            (merges all graphs)
    parse_trig12_named(text)  -> list of (graph_id, triples, namespaces)""" ;
    slkg:belongsToPackage <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/package/starlayergraph> ;
    slkg:commentText "---------------------------------------------------------------------------",
        "Matches start of a GRAPH block; group(1) captures the graph identifier token",
        "Public entry points",
        "Regex to strip prefix declarations from a chunk (we'll re-add them ourselves)",
        "TriG block extractor" ;
    slkg:contains <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._consume_balanced>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._extract_prefix_lines>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._extract_prefix_map>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._resolve_graph_id>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._split_trig_blocks>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._split_trig_blocks_with_ids>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12.extract_version_directive>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12.parse_trig12>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12.parse_trig12_named> ;
    slkg:defines <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._consume_balanced>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._extract_prefix_lines>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._extract_prefix_map>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._resolve_graph_id>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._split_trig_blocks>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12._split_trig_blocks_with_ids>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12.extract_version_directive>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12.parse_trig12>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trig12.parse_trig12_named> ;
    slkg:filePath "packages/graph/starlayergraph/parsers/trig12.py" ;
    slkg:importsModule <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/external/__future__>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/external/rdflib>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/external/re>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/module/starlayergraph.parsers.syntax>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/module/starlayergraph.parsers.turtle_parser> ;
    slkg:moduleName "starlayergraph.parsers.trig12" .

<https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/module/starlayergraph.parsers.trix12> a slkg:Module ;
    rdfs:label "starlayergraph.parsers.trix12" ;
    dcterms:identifier "starlayergraph.parsers.trix12" ;
    rdfs:comment """starlayergraph.parsers.trix12

Parse TriX 1.2 XML into triples, preserving or merging named-graph structure.

TriX is an XML-based named-graph format. Each <graph> block contains <triple>
elements whose three children are term nodes. RDF 1.2 triple terms are
represented by nesting another <triple> element in a term position (subject
or object) - the same element used for an asserted statement, disambiguated
only by structural position, not a distinct tag name. This matches Apache
Jena's real TriX writer/reader (confirmed empirically 2026-07-17 against a
live Fuseki 5.5.0: it emits a lowercase <trix> root element and nests
<triple> for a triple term - the only production TriX implementation found
to actually support RDF 1.2 triple terms, since Oxigraph doesn't implement
TriX at all). StarLayer originally invented its own <TriX>/<tripleTerm>
spelling before this was checked against a real implementation; both the
old root-tag capitalization and <tripleTerm> are still accepted here for
backward compatibility with anything already serialized by this parser's
own prior convention, but are no longer emitted (see trix12.py serializer).

Entry points:
    parse_trix12(text)        -> list of (s, p, o)            (merges all graphs)
    parse_trix12_named(text)  -> list of (graph_id, triples)  (preserves structure)""" ;
    slkg:belongsToPackage <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/package/starlayergraph> ;
    slkg:commentText "StarLayer's original (pre-Jena-comparison) spelling for a triple term -",
        "still accepted on read for backward compatibility, never written anymore." ;
    slkg:contains <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trix12._iter_graphs>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trix12._parse_graph>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trix12._parse_term>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trix12.parse_trix12>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trix12.parse_trix12_named> ;
    slkg:defines <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trix12._iter_graphs>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trix12._parse_graph>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starlayergraph.parsers.trix12._parse_term>,
