        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/method/starlayergraph.parsers.turtle_parser._Expander.__init__>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/method/starlayergraph.parsers.turtle_parser._Expander._alloc>,
