<https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/module/starsparql.to_rdf> a slkg:Module ;
    rdfs:label "starsparql.to_rdf" ;
    dcterms:identifier "starsparql.to_rdf" ;
    rdfs:comment """Encode a SPARQL algebra tree (rdflib CompValue/Expr nodes) as RDF triples.

One generic recursive walker handles every algebra operator and every
expression builtin uniformly — see ``vocab.py``'s module docstring for why
that is the design (and not one function per operator name).""" ;
    slkg:belongsToPackage <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/package/starsparql> ;
    slkg:commentText "\"Update quads-by-graph maps\" section.",
        "A CompValue key whose value, wherever it appears, is a graph-term-keyed",
        "Bookkeeping keys rdflib's own translateQuery() stamps onto every algebra",
        "_traverseAgg at the tail of translateQuery. Not real SPARQL algebra, so",
        "can be evaluated lazily) — see algebra.py's _addVars/analyse, run via",
        "map of triples rather than an ordinary nested algebra value — see vocab.py's",
        "node *after* building it, purely as a query-planning cache derived from",
        "not part of this vocabulary: skipped here, and recomputed the same way",
        "rdflib itself computes them after from_rdf.rdf_to_query decodes a tree.",
        "the tree's own structure (which variables a subtree binds, whether a Join" ;
    slkg:contains <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._build_rdf_list>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._encode>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._encode_binding_row>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._encode_comp_value>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._encode_list>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._encode_path>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._encode_prologue>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._encode_quads_map>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._encode_triple_pattern>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf._new_starlayer_graph>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf.queries_to_collection>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf.query_to_rdf>,
        <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/kg/resource/function/starsparql.to_rdf.update_to_rdf> ;
